From 464ead4c6aff502bf9ea3fb0d2b39a2cd9909cd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZKTeco <lifaet@zkteco.local>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:24:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Tier1 (dept daily + late/early + summary cards + door
 live pulse) + Tier3 analytics + seamless glass
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Dept daily: server-side dept param in AttendanceController@data (daily), frontend sends d.dept, toggle dept filter for daily, distinct from userDirectory
- Late/Early Flag: office_start 09:30 / office_end 17:00 via Setting (getValue/setValue), compute late_flag/early_flag/late_status per row, Flag column badge (Late/Early/On Time/Absent), row-late highlight, late count in summary
- Work Hours Summary Card: present/absent/late/avg_work before paginate, glass cards above table (daily only), drawCallback updates from json.summary, office hours in settings modal
- Door Monitor Live Pulse: Attendance2Controller@data includes name/title/dept + new summary() for /api/door-pulse (count today + last 5), attendance2.blade rewritten to share navbar-header/sidebar/content-wrapper glass, live dot + total today + last 5 unlocks poll 5s, toast on new punch
- Analytics Dashboard: new AnalyticsController (/analytics page + /api/analytics) with Chart.js — daily present % (month), dept avg hours, late trend 30d; office times in header
- Seamless integration: dashboard + attendance2 + analytics share same header/sidebar/layout, navigation highlight, colvis + glass styles, door badge uses door-pulse (fallback to attendance2-summary)
- Routes: /analytics + /api/analytics + /api/door-pulse, ATTENDANCE2_ENABLED guard kept
